<quest quest_id="201" category="lore_quest" tag="Beginnings" published="False" valid="True">
	<title>Beginnings</title>
	<description>Yours has always been my favorite. I have spun countless tales in my lifespan, chronicled epics and composed opi of legends. Your story, however, with its sheer mortal unpredictability, eluded even my own imaginations and predictions as to its direction. Your actions, motivations, and even reasoning has oft proved so vastly elusive as to amuse me to no end... I still remember that first day when, with the vale behind you, you began to seek answers...</description>
