		<node type="event_simple" id="6" tag="">
			<journal_entry>The Acolyte greeted you and offered some vague pleasantries accompanied by inane platitudes on the subject of the Vale and how those who emerge, more often than not, have that glassy eyed look of perplexity so often brought about by time spent with the Custodian.</journal_entry>
		</node>
		<node type="event_simple" id="7" tag="">
			<journal_entry>Some mild concern was expressed towards the events you described, however, and suggested you seek out the wisdom of a $[Resource.Q.r_qt_wordstone_NameSingular] to fill in the gaps. True to form, this Acolyte was about as useful as a fireball to the face and apparently even an old rock holds more intelligence!</journal_entry>
		</node>
